{"status":"ok","data":{"mode":"Local structured explainer","question":"Why did profit attributable to our shareholders change when group profit and cash were flat?","answer":"Profit attributable to owners of the parent rose by €0 (€1,568.50 in V1 → €1,568.50 in V2 (provisional)), while group profit (€2,086 → €2,086) and closing cash (€25,630 → €25,630) were flat.\n\nSource: AGS corrected intercompany invoice AGS-INV to AGL from €2,000 to €2,000, and AGL corrected its reciprocal invoice AGL-PINV to match. The intercompany sale is eliminated in full, so group revenue and group profit do not move.\n\nWhat moved is the margin AGS earned on goods still held in AGL's inventory. ELIM_UNREALISED_MARGIN removed €250 in V1 (journal RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V1:ELIM_UNREALISED_MARGIN@v1:AGS>AGL) and €250 in V2 (provisional) (journal RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V2-3:ELIM_UNREALISED_MARGIN@v1:AGS>AGL).\n\nAGS is the seller (upstream), so non-controlling interests bear their share: NCI = 40% × (850 − 0) = 340 in V1 (journal RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V1:ATTRIB_NCI@v1:AGA) vs 40% × (850 − 0) = 340 in V2 (provisional) (journal RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V2-3:ATTRIB_NCI@v1:AGA).\n\nProfit to owners of the parent = group profit − NCI share: 2,086 − 340 = 1,568.50 vs 2,086 − 340 = 1,568.50.","amounts":[{"token":"€0","value":"0.00","source":{"runId":"RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V2-3","kind":"compare","key":"compare.attr.parent","field":"absDelta"}},{"token":"€1,568.50","value":"1568.50","source":{"runId":"RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V1","kind":"statement","key":"attr.parent","field":"amount"}},{"token":"€1,568.50","value":"1568.50","source":{"runId":"RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V2-3","kind":"statement","key":"attr.parent","field":"amount"}},{"token":"€2,086","value":"2086.00","source":{"runId":"RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V1","kind":"statement","key":"pl.profit","field":"amount"}},{"token":"€2,086","value":"2086.00","source":{"runId":"RUN-AXADED3-20261121204752-V2-3","kind":"statement","ke